/T (By the end of 2025, the average daily population reached 6,665 inmates \(6,217 males and 448 females\). Population levels varied throughout the year, with slower growth early in 2025 followed by stronger growth in the middle and latter parts of the year. By 2026 Q2, the population had reached 6,681, starting to approach pre-COVID levels.)
/E (By the end of 2025, the average daily population reached 6,665 inmates \(6,217 males and 448 females\). Population levels varied throughout the year, with slower growth early in 2025 followed by stronger growth in the middle and latter parts of the year. By 2026 Q2, the population had reached 6,681, starting to approach pre-COVID levels.)
