/Title (Reliable prison projections remain an important tool for resource allocation and planning. Current five-year projections indicate that, absent significant internal, policy, or legislative changes, the population is expected to grow toward capacity over the five-year forecasting period, with annual growth ranging from 1.9% to 2.5%. Higher-growth scenarios increase the likelihood that this risk will occur sooner.)
